0..44 Comment "// This source shows laws in a theory model."
45..47 Comment "//"
48..127 Comment "// Each model proves every stated law at its carrier. A law is an equation that"
128..203 Comment "// a model proves. A rule is a rewrite that the theory orients. No rule can"
204..280 Comment "// state reflexivity, symmetry or transitivity. Symmetry has no orientation,"
281..342 Comment "// and the left side of reflexivity reads its variable twice."
343..345 Comment "//"
346..422 Comment "// The checker fills an omitted law when its sides convert. A host primitive"
423..498 Comment "// can admit a law that the host provides. The audit of the report lists an"
499..577 Comment "// admitted law in place of an obligation. An included theory carries its laws"
578..597 Comment "// into each model."
598..600 Comment "//"
601..616 Comment "// - see: #2356"
617..632 Comment "// - see: #4112"
633..680 Comment "// - see: pathological/modules/model-laws.gandr"
